{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48066","headline":"赠朋诗 · 魏朋妻","name":"赠朋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤坟临清江，每覩白日晚。\n松影摇长风，蟾光落嵓甸。\n故乡千里余，亲戚罕相见。\n望望空云山，哀哀泪如霰。\n恨爲泉台客，复此异乡县。\n愿言敦畴昔，勿以弃疵贱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏朋妻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}